### List leagues (defaults: sorted by name, offset 0, limit 25)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues
Accept: application/json

### Page through the list
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues?offset=0&limit=2
Accept: application/json

### Second page (follow links.next from the previous response)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues?offset=2&limit=2
Accept: application/json

### Sort by name, descending
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues?sort=-name
Accept: application/json

### Sort by division, then by name
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues?sort=divisionNumber,-name
Accept: application/json

### Only men's leagues (gender 1 = Men, 2 = Women)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues?gender=1
Accept: application/json

### Women's top division
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues?gender=2&division=1
Accept: application/json

### Filters, sort and paging together
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues?gender=1&sort=-divisionNumber&offset=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Offset beyond the end: 200 with empty items, not an error
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues?offset=1000
Accept: application/json

### Error: unknown sort field (400, errors.sort)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues?sort=height
Accept: application/json

### Error: limit out of range (400, errors.limit)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues?limit=0
Accept: application/json

### Error: limit above the maximum of 100 (400, errors.limit)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues?limit=1000
Accept: application/json

### Error: negative offset (400, errors.offset)
GET {{DataApi_HostAddress}}/api/{{ApiVersion}}/leagues?offset=-1
Accept: application/json
